  "releaseNotes": "- [ThunderPropagator#58] [Background Workers] IterativeFeeder — replace new Thread() with Task.Factory.StartNew(LongRunning) for proper task observation, exception propagation, and async runtime integration [Improvement]   IterativeFeeder.cs — all three remaining AC items:   - Added _backgroundTask = Task.CompletedTask field; the task returned from StartNew(...).Unwrap() is now stored instead of discarded with _   - Removed task.Dispose() from the ContinueWith (the task is kept alive for StopAsync)   - Added sealed override StopAsync that awaits _backgroundTask.WaitAsync(cancellationToken) with SuppressThrowing so cancellation/faults from the background loop don't surface as a stop error   - Added Thread.CurrentThread.Name = $'Feeder_{GetType().GetTypeInfo().Name}_{Channel.Metadata.ChannelName}' as the first line of Start()",
